Data usage terms for this repository
====================================

STATUS 2026-10-06: the operative reuse terms for this repository are the
"Data & Reuse" section of the README (free use including commercial, with
link-back + credit; no resubmission of listings to third-party aggregators
or feeds; enrichment fields are automated estimates provided as-is). The
Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0 text below applied to copies taken before
the licence change on 2026-10-06 and continues to govern those copies.

Job listings are public information provided by employers, who remain
responsible for their accuracy. The compilation and the added data fields
are by Zapply. You may use the name Zapply to attribute the data; please
do not use the Zapply logo or imply endorsement without written permission.

Questions or a different use? Open an issue. We say yes more often than not.

